{"id":"d7ddfbdf0ee2d47d","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-thm-martins-theorem.md","title":"Martin Theorem","display":"thm-martins-theorem — Martin Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-martins-theorem","aliases":["58-thm-martins-theorem"],"display":"thm-martins-theorem — Martin Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-borel-set.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-winning-strategy.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-martins-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-martins-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-martins-theorem — Martin Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dedfc8e5804658ad\" href=\"?note=dedfc8e5804658ad\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-borel-set.md\">../batch14/58-df-borel-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b74c79bf773960d3\" href=\"?note=b74c79bf773960d3\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-winning-strategy.md\">../batch05/58-df-winning-strategy.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>（玩家 I 在长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 的整数博弈中的收益集）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathrm{Baire}}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathrm{Baire}}\\)</span>（Baire 空间 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\omega^\\omega\\)</span> 的标准拓扑）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Borel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Borel}_S\\)</span>（三元 Borel 集谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dedfc8e5804658ad\" href=\"?note=dedfc8e5804658ad\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-borel-set.md\">../batch14/58-df-borel-set.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Strategy}_S,\\operatorname{Outcome}_S,\\operatorname{WinningStrategy}_{I,S}\">\\(\\operatorname{Strategy}_S,\\operatorname{Outcome}_S,\\operatorname{WinningStrategy}_{I,S}\\)</span>（策略、对局结果与玩家 I 的获胜策略谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b74c79bf773960d3\" href=\"?note=b74c79bf773960d3\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-winning-strategy.md\">../batch05/58-df-winning-strategy.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WinningStrategy}_{II,S}\">\\(\\operatorname{WinningStrategy}_{II,S}\\)</span>（下文按同一策略与结果谓词定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}winning\\text{-}strategy\\text{-}II}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{WinningStrategy}_{II,S}(\\tau,T,A,M)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\quad A\\subseteq\\{p\\in M^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(p\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\}\n\\land\\operatorname{Strategy}_S(\\tau,1,T,M)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad{}\\land\\forall\\sigma\\;\\left(\n\\operatorname{Strategy}_S(\\sigma,0,T,M)\\to\n\\exists p\\in\\left(\n\\{q\\in M^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(q\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\}\\setminus A\n\\right)\\;\n\\operatorname{Outcome}_S(p,\\sigma,\\tau,T,M)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}winning\\text{-}strategy\\text{-}II}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{WinningStrategy}_{II,S}(\\tau,T,A,M)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\quad A\\subseteq\\{p\\in M^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(p\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\}\n\\land\\operatorname{Strategy}_S(\\tau,1,T,M)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad{}\\land\\forall\\sigma\\;\\left(\n\\operatorname{Strategy}_S(\\sigma,0,T,M)\\to\n\\exists p\\in\\left(\n\\{q\\in M^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(q\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\}\\setminus A\n\\right)\\;\n\\operatorname{Outcome}_S(p,\\sigma,\\tau,T,M)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}martins\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{Borel}_S(A,\\omega^\\omega,\\tau_{\\mathrm{Baire}})\\to\n\\begin{aligned}[t]\n\\bigl(&amp;\\exists\\sigma\\;\\operatorname{WinningStrategy}_{I,S}\n(\\sigma,\\omega^{&lt;\\omega},A,\\omega)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\lor\\exists\\tau\\;\\operatorname{WinningStrategy}_{II,S}\n(\\tau,\\omega^{&lt;\\omega},A,\\omega)\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}martins\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{Borel}_S(A,\\omega^\\omega,\\tau_{\\mathrm{Baire}})\\to\n\\begin{aligned}[t]\n\\bigl(&amp;\\exists\\sigma\\;\\operatorname{WinningStrategy}_{I,S}\n(\\sigma,\\omega^{&lt;\\omega},A,\\omega)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\lor\\exists\\tau\\;\\operatorname{WinningStrategy}_{II,S}\n(\\tau,\\omega^{&lt;\\omega},A,\\omega)\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这就是 Martin 的 Borel 决定性定理：Borel 收益集对应的 Gale–Stewart 博弈必有一方拥有获胜策略。</li>\n<li>这里把博弈树固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，并直接复用上游的四元获胜策略签名；玩家 II 的谓词显式要求结果落在玩家 I 收益集的补集，避免把未定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Win}(i,G_A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Win}(i,G_A)\\)</span> 当作现成接口。</li>\n<li>结论只覆盖 Borel 收益集，不应省略收益集的正则性条件而误写成完全决定性公理。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-borel-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"dedfc8e5804658ad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-borel-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-winning-strategy.md","status":"resolved","id":"b74c79bf773960d3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-winning-strategy.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-borel-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"dedfc8e5804658ad","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Borel}_S$（三元 Borel 集谓词，见 [[../batch14/58-df-borel-set.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-winning-strategy.md","status":"resolved","id":"b74c79bf773960d3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Strategy}_S,\\operatorname{Outcome}_S,\\operatorname{WinningStrategy}_{I,S}$（策略、对局结果与玩家 I 的获胜策略谓词，见 [[../batch05/58-df-winning-strategy.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathrm{Baire}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Borel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Strategy}_S,\\operatorname{Outcome}_S,\\operatorname{WinningStrategy}_{I,S}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{WinningStrategy}_{II,S}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}winning\\text{-}strategy\\text{-}II}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\operatorname{WinningStrategy}_{II,S}(\\tau,T,A,M)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&\\quad A\\subseteq\\{p\\in M^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(p\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\}\n\\land\\operatorname{Strategy}_S(\\tau,1,T,M)\\\\\n&\\quad{}\\land\\forall\\sigma\\;\\left(\n\\operatorname{Strategy}_S(\\sigma,0,T,M)\\to\n\\exists p\\in\\left(\n\\{q\\in M^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(q\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\}\\setminus A\n\\right)\\;\n\\operatorname{Outcome}_S(p,\\sigma,\\tau,T,M)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}martins\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{Borel}_S(A,\\omega^\\omega,\\tau_{\\mathrm{Baire}})\\to\n\\begin{aligned}[t]\n\\bigl(&\\exists\\sigma\\;\\operatorname{WinningStrategy}_{I,S}\n(\\sigma,\\omega^{<\\omega},A,\\omega)\\\\\n&{}\\lor\\exists\\tau\\;\\operatorname{WinningStrategy}_{II,S}\n(\\tau,\\omega^{<\\omega},A,\\omega)\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Win}(i,G_A)","display":false}],"bytes":2303,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4303","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-thm-martins-theorem.md|58-thm-martins-theorem]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["dedfc8e5804658ad","b74c79bf773960d3"]}